From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: edwardzhu02 <explodingtnt@foxmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:04:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] stmp3770/hp39gii: enable the NAND driver, read-only hardware
 smoke test

- Run the GPMI clock from the 24 MHz crystal (BYPASS_GPMI) instead of
  assuming the 480 MHz PLL.  We do not call stmp3770_clockconfig() on
  hardware (it hangs the part), so the PLL state is unknown; the crystal
  path is always available, just slower.
- Replace the board NAND thread with a read-only test: init GPMI/ECC8,
  read pages 0, 1 and 1984 and print them in hex on the LCD console.
  The old thread formatted the NAND and wrote /data/hello.txt, which must
  not run against the stock firmware image.
- Enable CONFIG_STMP3770_NAND.

Verified in EmuGII: init OK, three pages read back (all 0xff on the blank
model NAND).
---
 arch/arm/src/stmp3770/stmp3770_gpmi.c         |  10 +-
 .../arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/hp39gii_boot.c   | 131 +++++-------------
 2 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 97 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/src/stmp3770/stmp3770_gpmi.c b/arch/arm/src/stmp3770/stmp3770_gpmi.c
index 34789967..57679df6 100644
--- a/arch/arm/src/stmp3770/stmp3770_gpmi.c
+++ b/arch/arm/src/stmp3770/stmp3770_gpmi.c
@@ -160,13 +160,15 @@ static void GPMI_ClockConfigure()
     BF_CLR(CLKCTRL_GPMI, CLKGATE);
     BF_CLR(CLKCTRL_FRAC, CLKGATEIO);
 
-    HW_CLKCTRL_GPMI_WR(BF_CLKCTRL_GPMI_DIV(2));    // 480 / 2 MHz
+    HW_CLKCTRL_GPMI_WR(BF_CLKCTRL_GPMI_DIV(2));
     INFO("GPMI CLK DIV:%d\n", BF_RD(CLKCTRL_GPMI, DIV));
-    //BF_CS1(CLKCTRL_GPMI, DIV, 2);
 
-    BF_CLR(CLKCTRL_CLKSEQ, BYPASS_GPMI);    //Set TO HF
+    /* 真机上没有跑 stmp3770_clockconfig()（会卡死芯片），PLL 状态未知。
+     * GPMI 直接旁路到 24 MHz 晶振，时序常数按 24 MHz 算，慢但一定能跑。 */
 
-    GPMIFreq = 480000000ULL / 2ULL;
+    BF_SET(CLKCTRL_CLKSEQ, BYPASS_GPMI);
+
+    GPMIFreq = 24000000ULL;
 
 
 }
diff --git a/boards/arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/hp39gii_boot.c b/boards/arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/hp39gii_boot.c
index 25ab04d3..771ec885 100644
--- a/boards/arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/hp39gii_boot.c
+++ b/boards/arm/stmp3770/hp39gii/src/hp39gii_boot.c
@@ -170,121 +170,66 @@ FAR struct mtd_dev_s *stmp3770_nand_initialize(void);
  * 打印前 32 字节。放在低优先级线程里，避免 GPMI 的轮询等待饿死 NSH。
  */
 
